Package: gnome-mac-gestures
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: tayvee-create <239965638+tayvee-create@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 48), libnotify-bin
Conflicts: mac-gestures
Replaces: mac-gestures
Homepage: https://github.com/tayvee-create/gnome-mac-gestures
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Description: Mac-style trackpad gestures for GNOME
 Adds an "Enable mac gestures" toggle (Quick Settings and its own settings
 window) that turns on tap to click, two-finger right-click, natural
 scrolling, pinch with thumb and three fingers for the app grid, and spread
 to show the desktop.
